3690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, responsive melee combat with an emphasis on breaking enemy posture to interrupt attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain different attacks together seamlessly as characters have different light, heavy, and charge attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to different enemies by utilizing unique sprinting, dodging, and air attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Counter attacks with each character\u2019s specialty of parrying, deflecting, or blocking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1655990/extras/8b9d6acaddaae98e4f44cfbda84d3b7c.poster.avif?t=1746633690\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1655990/extras/8b9d6acaddaae98e4f44cfbda84d3b7c.webm?t=1746633690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1655990/extras/8b9d6acaddaae98e4f44cfbda84d3b7c.mp4?t=1746633690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a variety of aggressive enemies, each with different methods of taking the player down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Factions influence fights. With factions being hostile to each other, players can force enemies to fight each other instead.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Use the ancient Godstone dagger to embody resurrected champions and fight with swappable abilities and items to reclaim the shattered lands. Mortal Rite is a crossover between a Souls-like and Roguelite game, single-player or up to 5-player Co-Op!",
